msgstr "Lunge 260 toward the target, then a crescent slash with 560 reach, up to 8 targets · 1000–1600% ATK, cannot crit · Opens a wound: +15% physical damage taken for 5 seconds · Targets with 3 Name Marks take +8–40% · A kill refunds 1 rune · Spends stored runes as a bonus, +10% each"

