msgstr "Do you hear that...? The thunder above floor 50 isn't coming from a storm. It's a drum.\n\nBronn, the Thunder Herald, beats his drum to send the hammer-bearer's orders down the trunk. Every time it sounds, the people below kneel without knowing why. Climb to floor 55 and silence that drum."

